This product is an agent skill (documentation plus a small Node.js lint script)
that teaches an AI coding agent to build user interfaces with Miuix
(the Compose Multiplatform UI library for Xiaomi HyperOS).

It is an independent work. It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by the Miuix project, Xiaomi, or any of the open-source projects
whose public source code was inspected while researching its conventions.

Third-party material
--------------------
- The component APIs, signatures and default values documented here were read
  from compose-miuix-ui/miuix (Apache-2.0).
- The layout conventions were researched by inspecting publicly available
  source code of several third-party applications. Those applications remain
  under their own licenses; only conventions and measurements were derived from
  them, and the code samples in this repository are illustrative
  re-implementations rather than copies. See the "来源与致谢" section of
  README.md for the list.
